{"title":"Cutthroat","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 22 Bandit that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/cutthroats-hone\">Cutthroats Hone</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>, <a href=\"#/item/pirates-windlass\">Pirates Windlass</a> <span class=\"muted\">(archers only; rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cutthroat\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cutthroat?lv=18\">Lv 18 <span>25</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cutthroat?lv=21\">Lv 21 <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cutthroat?lv=22\">Lv 22 <span>12</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/cutthroat?lv=23\">Lv 23 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/cutthroat?lv=24\">Lv 24 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cutthroat?lv=18\" title=\"Pick level 18\"><td><b>18</b></td><td>57</td><td>14.4</td><td>900</td><td class=\"muted\">171 · 20.2 · 2,700</td><td>25</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cutthroat?lv=21\" title=\"Pick level 21\"><td><b>21</b></td><td>70</td><td>16.1</td><td>1,050</td><td class=\"muted\">210 · 22.5 · 3,150</td><td>2</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cutthroat?lv=22\" title=\"Pick level 22\"><td><b>22</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>74</td><td>16.6</td><td>1,100</td><td class=\"muted\">222 · 23.2 · 3,300</td><td>12</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/cutthroat\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>23</b></td><td>79</td><td>17.2</td><td>1,150</td><td class=\"muted\">237 · 24.1 · 3,450</td><td>3</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/cutthroat?lv=24\" title=\"Pick level 24\"><td><b>24</b></td><td>84</td><td>17.7</td><td>1,200</td><td class=\"muted\">252 · 24.8 · 3,600</td><td>1</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"cutthroat\" data-map-level=\"23\">Show level 23 on the map</button>\n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/e9d4c1864d770936f05d.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/0e81ab2e03055fb04c81.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 15–24 · Bearhide armor</div></div></div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 4 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 8 recorded drops, 230 total, 12–37 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×12–37</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 7 total, 7 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×7</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bandit-bandana\" title=\"Bandit Bandana - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/3bc56e5e97ec8822834b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit Bandana</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"potato-seeds\" title=\"Potato Seeds - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/49e00cfee81da1a5b775.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Potato Seeds</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-torso\" title=\"Bearhide Torso - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ede6dbbeeddfa6e7c5c3.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bandit-tunic\" title=\"Bandit Tunic - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d7826cf6366831b7b094.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bandit Tunic</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"fine-trousers\" title=\"Fine Trousers - in 1 of 4 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/e55acc011886a033e0b5.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Fine Trousers</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/4<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Bandit Cave</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 25</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-72\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-4327.0px,-1667.9px)\"><img src=\"tiles/5/16/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4096px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/16/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4096px;top:1792px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/17/6.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4352px;top:1536px\"><img src=\"tiles/5/17/7.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:4352px;top:1792px\"><i style=\"left:4357.0px;top:1631.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:4392.9px;top:1660.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:4354.6px;top:1665.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:4297.9px;top:1674.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:4306.4px;top:1698.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:4297.9px;top:1669.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:4282.0px;top:1675.0px\"></i></div><figcaption>Wolfden</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Wolfden\">Wolfden</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 7 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"cutthroat\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Bandit: <a href=\"#/monster/footpad\">Footpad</a> <span class=\"muted\">(7)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/bandit\">Bandit</a> <span class=\"muted\">(14)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/brigand\">Brigand</a> <span class=\"muted\">(20)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/highwayman\">Highwayman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/sellsword\">Sellsword</a> <span class=\"muted\">(26)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/reaver\">Reaver</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/enforcer\">Enforcer</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/outlaw-captain\">Outlaw Captain</a> <span class=\"muted\">(34)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/0e81ab2e03055fb04c81.webp\" alt=\"Cutthroat\"></div><h3>Cutthroat</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>23</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 22)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Bandit</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>79</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>17.2</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1,150</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>4.0 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>17 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}